# Prover pack: a request-supplied name must not reach a filesystem handle.
#
# The synthetic helper validates and normalises a name but returns a string; it does
# not construct a FileInfo or FileStream. `Path.GetFullPath` is declared a sanitiser
# because the helper's real guard is `IsSegment` plus the prefix check — the EDB has no
# guard facts, so the pack states the effect the guard has as an assumption.
rule file-path
  kind taint
  severity error
  message A request-supplied name reaches a filesystem handle
  source Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpRequest.get_Headers result
  source Microsoft.AspNetCore.Http.HttpRequest.get_Query result
  sanitise System.IO.Path.GetFullPath result
  sanitise System.IO.Path.GetFileName result
  sink System.IO.FileInfo..ctor arg 0
  sink System.IO.FileStream..ctor arg 0
end
